IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TOKEN-SELECT-PRUNING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TOKENS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RETAINED-COUNT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FLOPS-REDUCTION-PCT PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-TOKEN-SELECT.
    IF NUM-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE FLOPS-REDUCTION-PCT = ((NUM-TOKENS - RETAINED-COUNT) * 75) / NUM-TOKENS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FLOPS-REDUCTION-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 RETAINED-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
